COMPILATION OF: E52PL

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52PL

   1 a 0000 E52PL: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* E52PL (picture operand p'99V.999': HC-vs-HD discriminator;
   3 a 0006       HC predicts b2=03, HD predicts b2=02) */
   4 a 0006    /* P3-3 decimal family: d fixed decimal(4,2) mirrors LOAN2's yi;
   5 a 0006       the picture operand under test is the ONE varying element. */
   6 c 0006    dcl d fixed decimal(4,2);
   7 c 0006    put edit(d)(p'99V.999');
   8 a 002A end E52PL;

CODE SIZE = 002D
DATA AREA = 0011
FREE SYMS = 38D4
END  COMPILATION
